  "facts": [
    "Completed in 2003, the Infante Dom Henrique Bridge replaced the upper deck of the Dom Luís I Bridge, freeing that historic span for the new Porto Metro D Line.",
    "Spanning 371 metres with a 280‑metre arch, the Infante Bridge boasts one of the shallowest arch ratios worldwide, inspired by alpine Maillart bridges.",
    "Standing 75 metres above the Douro River, the bridge’s arch rises only 25 metres above its cliff foundations, creating a dramatic yet subtle silhouette."
